### Raw benchmarks found

> **All benchmarks for this model are already researched and normalized in report 109** ([`../gemma-4.26b-a4b/Qwen_3.8_Max.md`](../gemma-4.26b-a4b/Qwen_3.8_Max.md)). Re-listing them here would duplicate that work and double-count the same artifact. This stub's own meta publishes **no benchmark numbers** (specs only); the canonical dot meta carries **AIME 88.3%, MMLU-Pro 82.6%** plus the AA/vendor set already scored there.

